    ct:description "or (B) as to a default under clause (ii) above, if such default is not cured within thirty (30) days after the defaulting party shall have  received written notice specifying in reasonable detail the nature of such default and such action the defaulting party must take in order to cure  each such item of default.     b) TERMINATION DUE TO INSOLVENCY. If either Party (the \"Bankrupt Party\"), (i) commences or becomes the subject of any case  or proceeding under the" ;
    ct:supported_by ex:C018P0017 ;
    meta:review_status "UNREVIEWED" .

